## .NET Performance Review — `DataSize.cs`

**Context:** Hot path — real-time dashboard, thousands of concurrent transfers.

---

### Scan Execution Checklist

| Recipe | Hits |
|--------|------|
| `.Replace(` | 7 (lines 179, 188, 194, 200, 206, 213, 219) |
