| Severity | Count | Top Issue |
|----------|-------|-----------|
| 🔴 Critical | 2 | 48-byte struct + 5 redundant divisions per construction; cascading string allocations in ToString |
| 🟡 Moderate | 2 | Duplicate cascade; non-readonly struct causing defensive copies |
| ℹ️ Info | 0 | — |

